# QRise Production Hardening — Implementation Plan & Task Breakdown

> **Generated**: 2026-05-02 | **Scope**: SaaS App + Admin Panel + Backend + Infra
> **Architecture**: Next.js 16 + Supabase + Drizzle ORM + Stripe + Upstash Redis + Vercel

---

## Architecture Map (Discovered)

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "SaaS App (qrise/)"
        PUB["Public Pages<br/>Landing, Pricing, Docs"]
        APP["App Pages<br/>Dashboard, QR, Forms, API Keys"]
        API["API Routes (31 dirs)<br/>/api/v1, /api/checkout, etc."]
        CRON["Cron Jobs (12)<br/>cleanup, webhooks, stripe sync"]
    end
    subgraph "Admin Panel (qrise-admin/)"
        ADM["Admin Pages (20 sections)<br/>Plans, Flags, Revenue, etc."]
        AAPI["Admin API (21 dirs)<br/>CRUD + Moderation"]
    end
    subgraph "Backend Services"
        DB["Drizzle ORM<br/>24 schema files"]
        WH["Webhook Engine<br/>signature, delivery, executor"]
        BILL["Billing<br/>Stripe + alerts"]
        FF["Feature Flags<br/>Redis-cached"]
        RL["Rate Limiting<br/>Upstash Ratelimit"]
        AUTH["Auth<br/>Supabase + API Keys"]
    end
    subgraph "External"
        STRIPE["Stripe"]
        REDIS["Upstash Redis"]
        SUPA["Supabase"]
        RESEND["Resend Email"]
    end
    APP --> API --> DB
    API --> WH --> STRIPE
    API --> RL --> REDIS
    ADM --> AAPI --> DB
    FF --> REDIS
    BILL --> STRIPE
    AUTH --> SUPA
```

---

## 🚨 Pre-Existing Bugs Discovered During Scan

| # | Severity | File | Issue |
|---|----------|------|-------|
| B1 | **CRITICAL** | `app/api/checkout/route.ts` | Missing `users` import — line 24 uses `users` table but never imports it. **Build will fail.** |
| B2 | **CRITICAL** | `app/api/checkout/route.ts` | Missing `Stripe` type import — line 45 uses `Stripe.Checkout.SessionCreateParams` without importing Stripe namespace. |
| B3 | **HIGH** | `lib/webhooks/executor.ts:66` | Latency calculation wrong: `Date.now() - timestamp` where timestamp is in seconds but Date.now() is in ms. |
| B4 | **HIGH** | `lib/webhooks/delivery.ts:104` | `getPendingDeliveries` only fetches `status='pending'` but retrying deliveries have `status='retrying'`. Retries never execute. |
| B5 | **MEDIUM** | `lib/sanitize.ts:55-59` | `stripHTMLTags` decodes HTML entities AFTER stripping tags — this re-introduces injectable content (`&lt;script&gt;` → `<script>`). |
| B6 | **MEDIUM** | `lib/api-auth.ts:73` | `requirePlanFeature` uses `@ts-ignore` for dynamic plan feature access — fragile, no type safety. |
| B7 | **LOW** | `app/api/webhooks/route.ts` | SSRF check missing `0.0.0.0`, `169.254.*` (link-local), and IPv6 private ranges. |

