## PHASE 3: DEBUGGING & FIXES

### Task 3.1 — Backend Fixes (Critical)
| ID | Task | Details | Files |
|----|------|---------|-------|
| 3.1.1 | **Fix checkout route imports** | Add `import { users } from '@/lib/db/schema'` and `import Stripe from 'stripe'` | `app/api/checkout/route.ts` |
| 3.1.2 | **Fix webhook latency calculation** | Change `Date.now() - timestamp` to `Date.now() - (timestamp * 1000)` | `lib/webhooks/executor.ts:66` |
| 3.1.3 | **Fix getPendingDeliveries to include retrying** | Add `or(eq(status, 'pending'), eq(status, 'retrying'))` with `lte(nextRetryAt, now)` | `lib/webhooks/delivery.ts:97-108` |
| 3.1.4 | **Fix XSS in stripHTMLTags** | Reverse order: decode entities BEFORE stripping tags, or remove entity decoding entirely | `lib/sanitize.ts:50-59` |
| 3.1.5 | **Fix requirePlanFeature type safety** | Replace `@ts-ignore` with proper typed plan feature lookup using `PlanFeatureKey` | `lib/api-auth.ts:60-75` |
| 3.1.6 | **Verify Stripe webhook idempotency** | Confirm `onConflictDoNothing` on `stripeEventId` prevents duplicate processing | `app/api/webhooks/stripe/route.ts` |

### Task 3.2 — Backend Fixes (High)
| ID | Task | Details | Files |
|----|------|---------|-------|
| 3.2.1 | Add `users` import to checkout route (duplicate of 3.1.1) | Already covered above | — |
| 3.2.2 | Validate all cron job routes have auth protection | Ensure `CRON_SECRET` header check on all 12 cron routes | `app/api/cron/*/route.ts` |
| 3.2.3 | Verify billing portal route exists and works | Check `app/api/billing/portal/` route | `app/api/billing/portal/route.ts` |
| 3.2.4 | Audit admin API authorization | All 21 admin API dirs must call `verifyAdmin()` | `qrise-admin/app/api/admin/` |

*   [x] 3.3.5 Verify empty states (Ensured all listing pages handle zero records)

